# Loch Lomond: traditional Scottish song, words as in Vocal Melodies of Scotland (1841).
{title: Loch Lomond}
{composer: Traditional (Scotland)}
{key: G}
{tempo: 84}
{time: 4/4}
{x_level: 2}
{x_strum: D - D U - U D U}

